	"notice": "Second-generation wired microKEY, not microKEY Air or the original generation. Shared microKEY family labels may not identify the generation or size; select the exact hardware manually when needed. The 25-key model has a joystick; larger models have wheels and an assignable switch socket. Physical controls and keys remain unbound because presets, modes and octave settings determine messages. Diagrams are selected-control schematics, not dimensioned panel drawings. Port names are recorded only when documented; otherwise detection uses an unambiguous complete model name or manual selection.",
